Z||000007||LS1swap||11-22-2001||06:59 AM||||I am sure someone can beat me, but I have over 250,000 on an 86 se. It was my daily driver until a couple of yeas ago  I am the original owner. It was running when I parked at my summer cottage two years ago. It still has its original engine. I did change the timing chain at about 180,000 as a preemptive measure ( although judging by the wear it would not have lasted much longer). If you change the oil every 3000 any car can make it ||||reg||1
