Z||000015||mrfiero||11-22-2001||03:02 PM||||I saw an '84 SE in a junkyrad (hit on the side) with 353,000 miles.  This was in a junkyard somewhere in central California.  I imagine that if it wasn't wrecked it would still be on the road today.....it was in very nice shape.<P>I have heard about that 400K+ mile coupe.....I believe it was an '88.  The later Dukes ('87-'88) are very reliable and durable if taken care of.....200-300K miles is not unreasonable with them (if maintained).<P>||||reg||1
